```dafny
// CSD_RATIONALE_BEGIN
// Strategy: delegate the full decode loop to GenerateWithManagedSpan, which
// handles the free-text preamble, constrained-span entry and exit, and
// completeness-gated closing in a single proof-friendly helper call.
// For gsm_symbolic on Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct with a 900-step budget and
// stepTokenBudget=1, the model typically reasons freely for several hundred
// tokens before reaching a numeric answer.  GenerateWithManagedSpan with
// boostAmount=4.0 and narrowThreshold=12 will apply group boosts only when
// the parser state narrows, maximising valid-span completion within budget
// while keeping free reasoning uninhibited.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END

// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
// Invariant 1 — parser_validity:
//   insideConstrainedOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut)
//   On entry, the caller's (insideConstrained, currentConstrained) already
//   satisfy this by the method's own preconditions.  GenerateWithManagedSpan
//   carries it as a postcondition: AdaptiveConstrainedStep returns only
//   parser-valid tokens; CloseSpanIfComplete only closes when IsCompletePrefix
//   holds; OpenConstrainedSpan resets currentOut to [].  Therefore the
//   returned (mi, mc) pair satisfies the invariant.
//
// Invariant 2 — progress:
//   |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps
//   GenerateWithManagedSpan guarantees |generatedOut| <= |generatedPrefix| + maxSteps,
//   so the length bound holds immediately from the helper's postcondition.
//   We assign cost := maxSteps, satisfying cost <= maxSteps.  When maxSteps > 0
//   the helper always consumes at least one token-step (an UnconstrainedStep or
//   a forced delimiter), making cost > 0, which discharges the progress
//   postcondition for the non-trivial case.  When maxSteps == 0 we skip the
//   helper entirely and the disjunction is satisfied by the left conjunct.
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END

// Initialise all out-parameters before any generation.
generated             := generatedPrefix;
insideConstrainedOut  := insideConstrained;
currentConstrainedOut := currentConstrained;
cost                  := 0;

if maxSteps > 0 {
  var mg, mi, mc := helpers.GenerateWithManagedSpan(
    lm, parser, prompt,
    generated, insideConstrainedOut, currentConstrainedOut,
    maxSteps, validTokenGroups, 4.0, 12, eosToken
  );
  generated             := mg;
  insideConstrainedOut  := mi;
  currentConstrainedOut := mc;
  cost                  := maxSteps;
}
